,\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145233A009.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"lzh\",\"userId\":1887171475342868481,\"categoryName\":\"出售\",\"categoryId\":1644303516352962562},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":1,\"userId\":1887171475342868481},{\"categoryId\":1602336520042287105,\"content\":\"信息墙主要提供表白交友、提问求助、吐槽提醒、遗失物招领、闲置物交易、兼职招聘等校园信息， 运营方联合校园相关部门人员管理，用户不得散播影响本校声誉等的不实谣言，违者将按校规严肃处理。\",\"contentId\":1908414450014052354,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 15:00:36\",\"fileCount\":0,\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":0,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"JCXYOZH\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145233A009.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"lzh\",\"userId\":1887171475342868481,\"categoryName\":\"日常分享\",\"categoryId\":1602336520042287105},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":0,\"userId\":18871',0,NULL,'2025-04-05 16:35:06'),(1908438305604591618,'campus','API接口日志记录','点赞','com.oddfar.campus.business.controller.web.UserActionController.zanContent()','GET',1,'/campus/zan/1908438151275175937','127.0.0.1','{contentId=1908438151275175937}','{\"msg\":\"success\",\"code\":200,\"data\":1}',0,NULL,'2025-04-05 16:35:24'),(1908438626397544449,'campus','API接口日志记录','获取校园墙内容','com.oddfar.campus.business.controller.admin.ContentController.getInfo()','GET',1,'/admin/content/1908438151275175937','127.0.0.1','{contentId=1908438151275175937}','{\"msg\":\"success\",\"code\":200,\"data\":{\"categoryId\":1644302032332709889,\"content\":\"为验证本校学生身份，信息墙邮箱绑定发帖功能需对用户已有信息进行二次核验才进行开放，有需求者请添加下方校园墙开发者QQ（备注加我的来意）作简式验证。\",\"contentId\":1908438151275175937,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 16:34:47\",\"fileCount\":1,\"fileUrl\":[\"/profile/CampusFile/2025/04/05/qrcode_1743841525441_20250405163421A012.jpg\"],\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":32,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"admin\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145416A010.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"admin\",\"userId\":1,\"categoryName\":\"交友\",\"categoryId\":1644302032332709889},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":1,\"userId\":1}}',0,NULL,'2025-04-05 16:36:4