数据及IP地址并会安排管理人员进行记录监视，违者将取消活动资格并永久封禁账号！\",\"contentId\":1908433958846029826,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 16:18:07\",\"fileCount\":1,\"fileUrl\":[\"/profile/CampusFile/2025/04/05/1743837767777-177188088_20250405154701A011.jpg\"],\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":27,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"JCXYOZH\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145233A009.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"lzh\",\"userId\":1887171475342868481,\"categoryName\":\"出售\",\"categoryId\":1644303516352962562},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":1,\"userId\":1887171475342868481},{\"categoryId\":1602336520042287105,\"content\":\"信息墙主要提供表白交友、提问求助、吐槽提醒、遗失物招领、闲置物交易、兼职招聘等校园信息， 运营方联合校园相关部门人员管理，用户不得散播影响本校声誉等的不实谣言，违者将按校规严肃处理。\",\"contentId\":1908414450014052354,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 15:00:36\",\"fileCount\":0,\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":9,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"JCXYOZH\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145233A009.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"lzh\",\"userId\":1887171475342868481,\"categoryName\":\"日常分享\",\"categoryId\":1602336520042287105},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":0,\"userId\":18871714753428684',0,NULL,'2025-04-05 16:59:11'),(1908444306416295937,'campus','API接口日志记录','查询分类列表','com.oddfar.campus.business.controller.web.CampusInfoController.categoryList()','GET',NULL,'/campus/categoryList','127.0.0.1','{}','{\"msg\":\"success\",\"code\":200,\"data\":[{\"categoryId\":1,\"categoryName\":\"最新墙\",\"createTime\":\"2024-12-30 20:11:41\",\"createUser\":1,\"description\":\"最近的墙内容(菜单默认选择这个)\",\"hasChildren\":false,\"icon\":\"system\",\"orderNum\":0,\"params\":{},\"parentId\":0,\"slug\":\"newest\",\"status\":\"0\",\"type\":\"Y\",\"updateTime\":\"2025-02-07 20:43:09\",\"updateUser\":1},{\"categoryId\":1449212758636646402,\"categoryName\":\"表白\",\"createTime\":\"2024-10-16 11:17:01\",\"description\":\"吐槽描述\",\"hasChildren\":false,\"icon\":\"system\",\"orderNum\":1,\"params\":{},\"parentId\":123,\"slug\":\"debunk\",\"status\":\"0\",\"type\":\"N\",\"updateTime\":\"2025-02-07 20:44:47\",\"up