行记录监视，违者将取消活动资格并永久封禁账号！\",\"contentId\":1908433958846029826,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 16:18:07\",\"fileCount\":1,\"fileUrl\":[\"/profile/CampusFile/2025/04/05/1743837767777-177188088_20250405154701A011.jpg\"],\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":27,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"JCXYOZH\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145233A009.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"lzh\",\"userId\":1887171475342868481,\"categoryName\":\"出售\",\"categoryId\":1644303516352962562},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":1,\"userId\":1887171475342868481},{\"categoryId\":1602336520042287105,\"content\":\"信息墙主要提供表白交友、提问求助、吐槽提醒、遗失物招领、闲置物交易、兼职招聘等校园信息， 运营方联合校园相关部门人员管理，用户不得散播影响本校声誉等的不实谣言，违者将按校规严肃处理。\",\"contentId\":1908414450014052354,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 15:00:36\",\"fileCount\":0,\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":9,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"JCXYOZH\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145233A009.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"lzh\",\"userId\":1887171475342868481,\"categoryName\":\"日常分享\",\"categoryId\":1602336520042287105},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":0,\"user',0,NULL,'2025-04-09 17:04:16'),(1909895148826267649,'campus','API接口日志记录','查询信息墙内容列表','com.oddfar.campus.business.controller.web.ContentInfoController.getContentList()','GET',NULL,'/campus/contentList','123.183.149.222','{}','{\"msg\":\"success\",\"total\":14,\"loveContentIds\":[],\"code\":200,\"rows\":[{\"categoryId\":1644303286433800193,\"content\":\"找代写\",\"contentId\":1908398252949987330,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 13:56:14\",\"fileCount\":1,\"fileUrl\":[\"/profile/CampusFile/2025/04/05/mmexport1743831597450_20250405135613A003.jpg\"],\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":1,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"墙墙管理员\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405144601A008.jpeg\",\"userName\":\"wallManage\",\"userId\":2,\"categoryName\":\"求购\",\"categoryId\":1644303286433800193},\"status\":1,\"tags\":[],\"type\":1,\"userId\":2},{\"categoryId\":1602336520042287105,\"content\":\"哪个好心人捡到充电宝啊？\",\"contentId\":1908397825089036290,\