加0.6元，允许同一参与者连续出价，最先拍得者可获得苹果手机所有权，校园信息墙平台将抽取最后拍得价的5%作为活动组织与技术服务费，活动最终解释权归校园信息墙运营方所有，期间平台将启用反爬虫系统，为了各位参与者的活动体验，建议使用信息墙app端参与活动，请大家公平竞争，勿使用各种脚本进行作弊，后台可记录用户异常登录数据及IP地址并会安排管理人员进行记录监视，违者将取消活动资格并永久封禁账号！\",\"contentId\":1908433958846029826,\"createTime\":\"2025-04-05 16:18:07\",\"fileCount\":1,\"fileUrl\":[\"/profile/CampusFile/2025/04/05/1743837767777-177188088_20250405154701A011.jpg\"],\"isAnonymous\":0,\"loveCount\":27,\"params\":{\"nickName\":\"JCXYOZH\",\"avatar\":\"/profile/avatar/2025/04/05/blob_20250405145233A009.',0,NULL,'2025-04-20 19:13:42'),(1913914575049723905,'campus','API接口日志记录','查询信息墙内容列表','com.oddfar.campus.business.controller.web.ContentInfoController.getSimpleHotContent()','GET',NULL,'/campus/simpleHotContent','127.0.0.1','{}','{\"msg\":\"success\",\"code\":200,\"data\":[{\"content\":\"【身份认证】为验证本...\",\"contentId\":1908438151275175937,\"loveCount\":32,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"H5端：http:/...\",\"contentId\":1909991604971114497,\"loveCount\":30,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"【拍卖】承接委托拍卖...\",\"contentId\":1908433958846029826,\"loveCount\":27,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"校园表白墙微服务架构...\",\"contentId\":1887857543478071297,\"loveCount\":23,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"校园表白墙后台管理系...\",\"contentId\":1888241125396664322,\"loveCount\":19,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"hello worl...\",\"contentId\":2,\"loveCount\":17,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"你好，welcome...\",\"contentId\":3,\"loveCount\":12,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"信息墙主要提供表白交...\",\"contentId\":1908414450014052354,\"loveCount\":9,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"壁纸分享\\n\",\"contentId\":1908173469100429313,\"loveCount\":8,\"params\":{}},{\"content\":\"哪个好心人捡到充电宝...\",\"contentId\":1908397825089036290,\"loveCount\":7,\"params\":{}}]}',0,NULL,'2025-04-20 19:16:08'),(1913914575062306818,'campus','API接口日志记录','查询分类列表','com.oddfar.campus.business.controller.web.CampusInfoController.categoryList()','GET',NULL,'/campus/categoryList','127.0.0.1','{}','{\"msg\":\"success\",\"code\":200,\"data\":[{\"categoryId\":1,\"c